mpa [buckets'])⟩, by simpa [buckets']⟩\n  else\n    let size'    := size + 1\n    let buckets' := buckets.uset i (AssocList.cons a b bkt) h\n    expandIfNecessary ⟨⟨size', buckets'⟩, by simpa [buckets']⟩","start":221,"end":232},"axioms":["Quot.sound","propext"]}